  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="0a4d4521-7c43-577c-b5d7-758f33c93e8c" activityNameId="76a38a16-3c95-5990-815d-4b53c00ab249" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Crude oil, at production offshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Crude oil, at production offshore
The offshore oil production delivers the product crude oil. The values are derived from a multioutput-process "combined offshore gas and oil production" by allocation based on heating values for crude oil and natural gas UUID=5ef87b95-769e-34f3-9e23-cc50962c310e
Production of crude oil including energy use, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: Data valid for CN.
Technology: 4 % offshore and  96 % onshore production
Time period: Time of most relevant publications and statistics. Other generic data, e.g. for infrastructure are based on older publications.
Production volume: 8 megatons of crude oil per year in 2023.
Sampling: Statistics and use of generic data
Extrapolations: A part of the data has been estimated with generic assumptions for offshore production.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5ef87b95-769e-34f3-9e23-cc50962c310e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="3142d8e2-0d30-557e-b090-9faae2b72357" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CN</shortname>
        <comment>
